  "title": "Qt: fix info banner Coverity Identical code for different branches",
  "description": "Fix Coverity Identical code for different branches warning.\n\nThe same code is executed under if/else.\n\n- One shall be `Qt::PointingHandCursor`\n- While the other `Qt::ArrowCursor`\n\n```\nCID 1685384: (#1 of 1): Identical code for different branches (IDENTICAL_BRANCHES)\n\nidentical_branches: The same code is executed regardless of whether (btn.isValid() && btn.contains(QPoint(event->pos()), false)) || this->dotHitTest(QPoint(event->pos())) >= 0 is true, because the then and else branches are identical. Should one of the branches be modified, or the entire if statement replaced?\n```\n\nCoverity CID 1685384\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
